# T1 v2 (iOS Diag T1, commit 86346c224, Mac hashes in ERISTA_T1.md) on a physical Erista (t210b01=0, sku=0), 2026-11-25, hekate 6.5.5, started from Nyx More configs.
# Transcribed by the reviewer from the photograph and given to this repository as text; the photograph was not seen here.
# The run stopped with code 0507 at the first transfer, drew its report, waited and reset; hekate came back by itself with no
# button hold (confirmed by the operator, not in the photograph). Nothing was run to check Nyx's temperature control afterwards.
HIDREV 00022117
ODM4 00000204
BOARD ERISTA T210B01=0 SKU=0 BOOT=0
EL1 EL=4 SCTLR=30D00800 DAIF=3C0
CNTFRQ=19200000 HCR=80000000 CNTHCTL=3 CNTVOFF=0
EL1 STATE PASS
ISAR0 0000000000011120 CRC32 1 OK
ENTRY SP FF87DD10 IN NATIVE_GATE RANGE

CAR RST_L 049102CA
ENB_L 9802D131
SRC_I2C1 00000003
SRC_PWM C0000004

I2C1 CLOCK ON OUT OF RESET
PWM CLOCK ON OUT OF RESET

I2C1 CNFG 00002842
STATUS 00000000
INT 00000000
DIV 00050001
LOAD 00000004

PAD SCL 00000040 SDA 00000040

T1 STOPPED CODE 0507. NO ACK FROM 0X4C
TRANSFERS 0 OF 10
NO RETRY. NO SENSOR WRITE.
FAN AND PWM UNTOUCHED.
STATUS AFTER 00000001

BOOT STAYS 0.
NO KERNEL WINDOW IN THIS BUILD.
RESET IN 15 S.
